@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam ArrowColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #111111
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #111111
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white

actor "用户" as User
participant "题目详情页" as Page
participant "Gateway" as Gateway
participant "SendAiAnalysisService" as QuestionService
database "Redis" as Redis
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "AiAnalysisConsumer" as Consumer
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "ChatSiliconflowAiService" as AI
participant "NotificationService" as Notify

User -> Page: 点击 AI 解析
Page -> Gateway: POST /user/aiAnalysis/sendAiAnalysis
Gateway -> QuestionService: 转发解析请求
QuestionService -> DB: 查询答题记录
DB --> QuestionService: 返回记录
QuestionService -> Redis: 检查解析锁
Redis --> QuestionService: 返回锁状态

alt 已解析或正在解析
  QuestionService --> Page: 返回已存在结果或处理中状态
else 可发起解析
  QuestionService -> Redis: 写入解析锁
  QuestionService -> MQ: 发送 AiAnalysisMessage
  QuestionService --> Page: 返回请求已受理

  MQ -> Consumer: 投递解析消息
  Consumer -> DB: 查询题目与答题记录
  DB --> Consumer: 返回题目内容与用户答案
  Consumer -> AI: 调用大模型评分与解析
  AI --> Consumer: 返回准确率与解析文本
  Consumer -> DB: 保存 AI 分析结果
  Consumer -> Redis: 释放解析锁
  Consumer -> Notify: 发送结果完成通知
  Notify --> Page: SSE / 消息提醒
end
@enduml
